WEBVTT

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.580
Ch-Chihiro-san?

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.710
He's awoken. This is a bother.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:05.960
Yes.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:16.410
I'm disappointed, Chihiro-kun.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:51.020
You Don't Know Who I Am Yet

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:59.270
Huh? What have I...

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:05.220
What the?

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:12.040
I did... this?

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:16.570
Kotetsu.

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:27.540
No...

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:32.960
I...

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:35.860
I...

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:37.600
I did this to him?

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.230
Ch-Chihiro-san...

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:05.330
You're all right now.

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:08.190
H-How is he?

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:09.110
He's fine.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:10.920
He's just sleeping.

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:12.340
Is he hurt?

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.810
He just got slashed.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.060
Wh-What's going on?

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.810
Why is Chihiro-san still alive?

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:23.960
It vanished.

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:28.790
Hey... Was that really Dad?

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:30.770
Yes, unfortunately.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:32.870
Why?! I don't get it!

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:33.970
Calm down!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:39.730
Don't say anything right now.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:41.780
I'll explain everything later.

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:48.780
Kurokami.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:49.930
Kurokami Marie.

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:52.330
What happened here?

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:53.900
Don't let him in.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:54.800
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:55.650
Hey!

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:00.020
So, what happened to that freak?

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:03.570
I don't know.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.580
I lost consciousness right away.

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:11.200
You're his son, aren't you?

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:12.990
Did you see the monster?

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:15.470
I don't know.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:16.870
Are you sure?

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:20.350
I don't know. I'm sorry.

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:24.510
You don't seem to be from around here.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.040
Morizono Eiko.

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:29.970
I'm in Kamina-kun's seminar class at university.

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:34.750
I came to talk to him about
something, and this is what I saw.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:36.340
It was really just a coincidence.

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:38.090
A coincidence?

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:40.490
Of course.

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:46.330
Kamina was living here with you, wasn't he?

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:47.710
Where is he now?

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:49.790
He's still unconscious.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:52.490
I don't think he's seen anything, either.

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:54.620
How can you be so sure?

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:57.120
What are you suggesting, exactly?

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:01.150
True, all there is is a broken gate,

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:03.370
and Kotetsu's father is missing.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.300
Be sure to file a missing person report later.

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:11.240
There are a lot of similar disappearances
happening in Tokyo recently.

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.390
So it's not all that unusual.

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:19.230
After all, tens of thousands of people
vanished after the Great Collapse.

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:22.400
We don't know what happened to them.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:27.260
There are dubious rumors going about
that they became the red mist.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.860
The red mist...

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:33.830
Speaking of dubious, there <i>are</i> reports

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.840
that humans have been turning into monsters.

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:41.140
Of course, when we get there,
there's no such monster.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.880
They may just be urban legends, but...

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.970
Something's happening again, here in Tokyo.

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:59.220
Who are you?

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.050
The "coincidence" thing was a lie, right?

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:05.450
If you know something, tell me.

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:09.760
Who was that monster?

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:12.110
What happened to Chihiro-san?

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:15.930
Is something up with me?

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.040
Is this just all a weird dream?

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.410
It's not a dream.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:25.540
Accept that it's happening.

00:07:25.870 --> 00:07:31.010
If that monster is Dad,
why did he become that way?

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.810
Your father was changed.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.300
Changed?

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:39.060
I'm sure you've seen the man in
a blue jacket and sunglasses.

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:43.540
He did that to Dad?

00:07:44.470 --> 00:07:45.620
But why?!

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:46.650
How?!

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:50.930
I'll tell you later.

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:55.650
I'm sure the master would like to know, too.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:14.140
Chihiro-kun.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.210
Where am I?

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:21.900
Kotetsu?

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:24.690
Are you awake?

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:26.680
Who are you?

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.480
No, you need to stay put.

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:32.440
You're from the seminar class.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:35.370
You used up so much power.

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:37.460
You need to rest for a bit longer.

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:38.970
Power...

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:47.710
Your wound's fine now.

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:50.770
What about Kotetsu's dad?

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:52.980
What happened to him?

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.220
I'm sorry, but...

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:06.280
I did it?

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.370
I did.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:47.060
Parent kills son, takes own life
Tragedy in peaceful mountains

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:50.060
The late Kamina Daichi

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:50.060
There you go again, reading that stuff.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:53.470
An instructor and foster father went missing.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:55.690
You need to focus on the work in front of you.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:58.780
The rent's due for both this
month and last month.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:02.920
We finally got permission
for an investigation.

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:06.660
I gathered some info on both
the university and the foundation.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.460
I'm counting on you, Kakihara-san.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:13.550
Here you are.

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.550
Eat up.

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:18.570
What's wrong?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:21.400
Why did you make breakfast?

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.250
For the master.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:25.520
What do you mean, "master"?

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.520
Master.

00:10:28.610 --> 00:10:30.010
Listen...

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:32.080
Morizono-san, what's the meaning of this?

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.450
Why are you here?

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:37.280
I've hardly even spoken to you.

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:42.770
So that was the extent of your
relationship with Morizono Eiko, huh?

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:44.500
What a shame.

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:46.880
What do you mean?

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:48.820
I'll explain when the time is right.

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:50.370
Stop it!

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.500
You know things, don't you? Tell us, now!

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:56.340
You'd never understand.

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:57.320
What?

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:58.630
I'll explain later.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:00.630
Your breakfast's going to get cold.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.090
Who are you?

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:05.280
Please don't be so upset.

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:08.240
I'm waiting for you to remember, too.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:09.800
Remember?

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:12.410
Now, then. We have to eat.

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:14.340
You bled out so much.

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:17.500
There's no telling when something's
going to happen again.

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:18.990
Meals are important.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:18.990
Stop.

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:22.320
Stop, please. I'm begging you.

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:25.870
Kotetsu.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.960
I'm sorry, I...

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:31.920
We always had Japanese breakfasts.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:35.690
I need Chihiro-san's layered
omelets for strength.

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:49.020
Would you forgive me?

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:52.020
Life and death are two faces of the same coin

00:12:07.650 --> 00:12:09.120
You can't, can you?

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:18.710
My hand's been covered in blood,

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:25.720
ever since back then.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:32.160
We're making the inter-school meet this year.

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:36.040
We gotta work hard to keep
the Neo-triathlon Club alive.

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:38.030
What a pain in the neck.

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:39.580
Are you listening?

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:42.240
Shut up, I haven't slept much.

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:45.080
That's what you get for hanging
out with biker gangs.

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:47.700
You should really quit.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:50.670
They aren't biker gangs. They're Blue Skull.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:53.590
Why do we have to come to school?

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:55.020
Because we have class.

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:56.840
This isn't the time for that.

00:12:57.180 --> 00:12:59.190
Then what <i>is</i> it the time for?

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:01.960
Staying at home and wallowing in regret?

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:05.560
Wearing yourself out
over pent-up emotions?

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:07.580
I can't have you doing that.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:09.890
It's dangerous enough as it is.

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:14.520
This is bad, get back.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.550
What's gotten into him?

00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:18.520
He's just like your dad.

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:23.690
Get back. It'll be dangerous if a gate opens.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:25.410
Come on, let's go.

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:26.540
Y-Yeah.

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:28.200
Move it, move it!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.820
Settle down!

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:36.200
All right, Sakiyama.

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:37.620
Take him to the hospital.

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:40.110
What a pain.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.090
It's the Sleeping Prince.

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:47.890
That's right, you're a student here.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.550
How are you doing?

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:51.510
Why are you here, Doctor?

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:53.750
Are you still half asleep?

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:55.800
I work at Jokei University Hospital.

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:57.460
We're in the same campus.

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:01.020
I have a course here today—

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.020
Inuki!

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:02.610
Let's go!

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:04.720
Well, then.

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:12.530
D-Doctor...

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:16.640
You...

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:20.360
I see...

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:22.900
So you <i>are</i>...

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:24.250
Inuki!

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:27.320
Kamina Chihiro-kun, was it?

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.480
I think I'll be seeing you around.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:34.250
What's with that guy?

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.210
Vessel of Heroic Blood.

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:43.810
You said that frantic man from
earlier was the same as his dad.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:45.870
No...

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:47.860
There was a chance he could have changed.

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:51.200
If the gate had opened, that is.

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:53.010
Gate?

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:55.360
They come through the gates.

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:56.640
They come?

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.370
Put simply, from another world.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:00.860
What?

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:02.830
You must have seen it with your own eyes.

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.290
Your father, too...

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:05.470
That's enough.

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:08.740
They'll never stop threatening us.

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:10.630
We can only fight and defeat them.

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:12.120
Defeat them?

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:13.850
You make it sound so easy.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.730
There was nothing you could have done.

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:17.830
There's need to feel guilt—

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.170
Cut the crap!

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:20.990
I just lost someone important to me!

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:23.230
Worse, I did it myself, again!

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.110
Chihiro-san...

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:30.490
You survived.

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:33.510
When did I ever ask to live?

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:37.260
You're essential to the new world.

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:39.960
I will ensure you continue to live,
no matter what you want.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.440
That's why I've come here.

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:45.900
Just who are you?

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:47.320
I'm sure you know.

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:48.630
Don't mess with me!

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:49.900
I...

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:54.550
Chihiro-san!

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:56.720
I'm fine.

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:09.400
What's happened to me?

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:16.700
That sound...

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:26.960
That was...

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:32.450
Wait!

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.680
Chihiro-san's taking a while, don't you think?

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:41.370
Yes.

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:52.430
If the inappropriate donations from
the Foundation to Jokei University

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:56.490
were in return for providing
personnel, there could be a problem.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:17:01.360
The students' employment is being
decided behind their backs, after all.

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:03.500
H-Hey... Not right now.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:06.410
That's why we're talking out of the office.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:08.500
Or would you prefer that I speak louder?

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:13.010
Tell me what's going on between
AVAL Science Foundation!

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:17.470
J-Just come to my place!

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:27.900
Huh?

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:30.410
Chihiro? What are you doing here?

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:35.170
Oh, nothing.

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:42.150
Get a grip, Ikuro!

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:47.130
You're...

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:51.160
If only you'd died.

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:58.010
Ikuro!

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:05.890
Stop! Stop it!

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:12.910
Ikuro!

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:13.880
Stop!

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.240
Stop, please!

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:19.240
I'm begging you, stop!

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:22.990
Are you defying your orders?

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:26.130
Death to the Heroic Lineage.

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:28.710
Do it, Yuri.

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:32.060
Chihiro-san!

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:35.050
Iku-san!

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:39.260
You're...

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:42.250
Fine, I'll do it.

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:52.810
M-My head's going to burst.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.190
Kotetsu!

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:58.150
Hurry, wake up!

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:01.620
Remember who you really are!

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:03.970
Who I really am?

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:07.600
Give yourself to the Heroic
Blood sleeping inside you!

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:09.710
Your blood will do the rest.

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:21.870
I can't. I can't do it.

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:23.380
What are you talking about?

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:24.380
If...

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:27.100
What if Kotetsu becomes a monster?

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:28.970
Am I going to...

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:34.040
Do you want to die?

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:39.180
I can't just kill someone precious to me!

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:42.360
I'd rather die instead!

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:46.210
Kotetsu...

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:52.080
You <i>did</i>...

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:55.750
You killed Dad!

00:19:57.750 --> 00:19:58.650
Kotetsu!

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:11.000
He was a Vessel of Heroic Blood, too?

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:13.930
Where did he go?

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:16.490
This way?

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:24.250
To think there was another.

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:27.600
Well, this creates a good opportunity
to take out both of you.

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:31.910
No!

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.420
You... Again?!

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:42.960
Death to the Heroic Lineage.

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.530
It's... strong!

00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:03.490
He's in danger.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:06.950
But I...

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:12.200
What did I do when I killed his dad?

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:15.160
I don't remember anything.

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:19.500
I can't wake up to see
another person I've killed.

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:21.720
I can't.

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:24.800
I don't want to soak my hands
in any more blood.

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:40.020
Kotetsu!
